    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits enterprise agreement application";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) an enterprise agreement applies to an employee in relation to particular employment; and (b) a workplace determination that covers the employee in relation to the same employment comes into operation;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the enterprise agreement ceases to apply to the employee in relation to that employment, and can never so apply again.";
