    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Describes a temporal relationship between workplace determinations and enterprise agreements.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) If: (a) a workplace determination applies to an employee in relation to particular employment; and (b) an enterprise agreement that covers the employee in relation to the same employment comes into operation;";
