    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Exemption";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Exempts conduct from pecuniary penalty if retrospective effect would not have contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or enterprise agreement.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) If: (a) a person engaged in conduct before the determination was made; and (b) but for the retrospective effect of the determination, the conduct would not have contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or an enterprise agreement;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "A court must not order the person to pay a pecuniary penalty under Division 2 of Part 4-1 in relation to the conduct, on the grounds that the conduct contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or enterprise agreement.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
