    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Overlaps";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The retrospective effect of the determination overlaps with the conduct before determination.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) If: (a) a person engaged in conduct before the determination was made; and (b) but for the retrospective effect of the determination, the conduct would not have contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or an enterprise agreement;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The retrospective effect of the determination overlaps with the conduct before determination.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::interval_reasoning";
