<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/fair-work-act-2009-sec-298-ss-2-logic-ltl-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LTL>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Repeats";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The conduct before determination repeats the conduct after determination in terms of its impact on the national minimum wage order or enterprise agreement.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) If: (a) a person engaged in conduct before the determination was made; and (b) but for the retrospective effect of the determination, the conduct would not have contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or an enterprise agreement;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The conduct before determination repeats the conduct after determination.";
