    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Permissive";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Permits conduct before determination if retrospective effect would not have contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or enterprise agreement.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) If: (a) a person engaged in conduct before the determination was made; and (b) but for the retrospective effect of the determination, the conduct would not have contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or an enterprise agreement;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The conduct is permitted if the retrospective effect would not have contravened a term of the national minimum wage order or enterprise agreement.";
