    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) a named employer award covers the new employer because of paragraph 313(1)(a); and (b) the named employer award covered an employer organisation in relation to the old employer immediately before the termination of a transferring employee’s employment with the old employer;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "then the named employer award covers the employer organisation in relation to the new employer.";
