    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Presumption of action being taken for a particular reason or intent.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) If: (a) in an application in relation to a contravention of this Part, it is alleged that a person took, or is taking, action for a particular reason or with a particular intent; and";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "it is presumed that the action was, or is being, taken for that reason or with that intent, unless the person proves otherwise.";
