<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/fair-work-act-2009-sec-386-ss-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "386(1) Meaning of dismissed"@en;
