<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/fair-work-act-2009-sec-386-ss-1> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/fair-work-act-2009-sec-386-ss-1-logic-deontic-1>.
