    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Requires protected action ballots to be held at the same time.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) that the level of disruption of the employer’s enterprise, or at the workplace, could be reduced if the ballots were held at the same time;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(b) that requiring the ballots to be held at the same time will not unreasonably delay either ballot.";
