    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(A) Collective agreement does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a collective agreement, unless the agreement applies to the person.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(B) A collective agreement imposes obligations on a person unless the agreement applies to the person.";
