    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Overlaps";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "A and B overlap if there exists a time interval I such that A starts before I ends and I ends after B starts.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) Collective agreement does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a collective agreement, unless the agreement applies to the person.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(2) The agreement applies to the person if and only if the person is subject to the agreement during some time interval I.";
